      "uid": "zhcn:5e6074c282f9250eaa7982eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉八重，\n小栗前辈其实是个最强最棒的赛马娘。\n正因为实力坚强，才让大家的“梦想”熠熠生辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "244d861ce8897b14394e49560c6f6050dbbfb351e7783037e712687a40e36e3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
