      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f887a5ff91bdbbcfc81523d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的对决让我明白到，\n小栗前辈就存在于我“梦想”的中心。\n因此，我想要成为前辈最棒的劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b0b6f266cd17f00f9fb8006beaeec1bf4d0e890241bf1e76bf305b1ad1a947",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33de709b5d27c8fc906a48a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "青竹回忆",
      "source_fingerprint": "10c0e62c9c29b0c7110fc490d820aac2e1803271ecdde3830e065a1ed9bdb2d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd249fb3f06be315b3afd452",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了变强，下一场比赛我要以\n“宝冢纪念”为目标！八重和千代王也会参加那场\n汇集世代“梦想”的赛事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2c7491f43c1e218f975a8765826c49b2d7814b8dca6c483fc97b8c15d498d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710460e64a766725efe89728",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "安田纪念结束后・迈向梦想汇集的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ab7efd722bf4527a0980fc171fd7d5147680b274f0df64716fbab5dc974e80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
