    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caafd992ef3ec247d2d373e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能参加这场比赛真是太好了！\n我从大家那边收到的“梦想”还在燃烧！\n希望还能跟她们来一场“梦想”交会的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c23559615d38ae4d6bf8c1d749e1749f5a21819dda5994fb9f50704e3c4ec6a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053424.json",
      "json_path": [
