    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2203897a36875cef56f52f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“短途马锦标”！\n为了成为小栗前辈最棒的劲敌，\n我要站上短距离的巅峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "281e38c991ccd749bda503f07a629de4f4a85619e148ecf5b7e897d2cc31b943",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
