      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赢了……！在“短途马锦标”……！\n我站上了短距离的巅峰……！！\n喔喔喔喔！！超开心的啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "436a662c8e994270c79fb8f0b41ca55faf0102ca4fe7d74ab214e26e42d71f05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
